   "level": 4,
   "text": "NEW PATIENT SPECIAL",
   "section": 4
  },
  {
   "type": "para",
   "text": "Only $129* for ages 12 and under! This special includes a comprehensive exam, necessary X-rays and cleaning. Plus, enjoy a FREE fluoride treatment on us!",
   "html": "<p>Only $129* for ages 12 and under! This special includes a comprehensive exam, necessary X-rays and cleaning. Plus, enjoy a <b>FREE fluoride treatment</b> on us!</p>",
   "section": 4
  },
  {
   "type": "para",
   "text": "Limited emergency exam for just $85!",
   "html": "<p>Limited emergency exam for just $85!</p>",
   "section": 4
  },
  {
   "type": "para",
   "text": "(*Cannot be combined with insurance, new patients only, not valid in cases of periodontal disease.)",
   "html": "<p>(*Cannot be combined with insurance, new patients only, not valid in cases of periodontal disease.)</p>",
   "section": 4
  },
  {
   "type": "para",
   "text": "Just $189* for ages 13 and up! This special includes a comprehensive exam, necessary X-rays and cleaning. Plus, enjoy a FREE fluoride treatment on us!",
   "html": "<p>Just $189* for ages 13 and up! This special includes a comprehensive exam, necessary X-rays and cleaning. Plus, enjoy a <b>FREE fluoride treatment</b> on us!</p>",
   "section": 4
  },
  {
   "type": "heading",
   "level": 3,
   "text": "COMPLIMENTARY INVISALIGN CONSULT AVAILABLE",
   "section": 5
  },
  {
   "type": "cta",
